{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-energy","title":"清洁能源技术","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 清洁能源技术\n\n## 概述\n\n清洁能源技术是实现碳中和与能源转型的核心工具。本 Hub 聚焦各类清洁能源的技术原理、商业化现状、经济可行性与未来技术路线，与 Hub 1（气候变化基础）形成互补——后者回答\"为何要转型\"，本 Hub 回答\"用什么技术转型\"。\n\n## 章节结构\n\n本 Hub 包含 4 个章节、12 篇文档：\n\n### 第一章：太阳能技术\n\n从晶硅光伏的工作原理与产业链，到钙钛矿叠层电池的效率突破，再到聚光太阳能的热储能优势，覆盖太阳能全技术谱系。\n\n### 第二章：风能技术\n\n涵盖陆上风电的大型化趋势、海上与漂浮式风电的深远海开发，以及风机核心技术（直驱、超导、碳纤维叶片）的演进方向。\n\n### 第三章：核能与氢能\n\n覆盖先进核裂变（Gen III+/IV）、小型模块化反应堆（SMR）的经济性与监管路径，以及氢能经济体系（制取-储运-应用）的全链条。\n\n### 第四章：水电与新兴可再生能源\n\n包括抽水蓄能的调峰价值、地热能的深层开发、潮汐能与生物质能的前沿进展。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。太阳能和风能是当前部署规模最大的清洁电力来源，理解它们的技术经济性是基础；核能与氢能是关键补充赛道；水电及新兴能源提供完整视野。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 基础物理（能量转换、电磁感应、热力学）\n- 基础化学（电化学、催化）\n- 已读：气候变化基础（本类目 Hub 1）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solar-energy","title":"太阳能技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photovoltaic-fundamentals","title":"光伏发电原理与产业链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/photovoltaic-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"perovskite-tandem-cells","title":"钙钛矿与叠层电池技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/perovskite-tandem-cells"},{"seq":3,"slug":"concentrated-solar-storage","title":"聚光太阳能与光热储能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/concentrated-solar-storage"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"wind-energy","title":"风能技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onshore-wind-systems","title":"陆上风电系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/onshore-wind-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"offshore-floating-wind","title":"海上与漂浮式风电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/offshore-floating-wind"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wind-turbine-technology","title":"风机核心技术演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/wind-energy/wind-turbine-technology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nuclear-hydrogen","title":"核能与氢能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-nuclear-fission","title":"先进核裂变技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/advanced-nuclear-fission"},{"seq":2,"slug":"small-modular-reactors","title":"小型模块化反应堆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/small-modular-reactors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hydrogen-economy","title":"氢能经济体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/hydrogen-economy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hydro-geothermal-emerging","title":"水电与新兴可再生能源","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydropower-pumped-storage","title":"水力发电与抽水蓄能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/hydropower-pumped-storage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geothermal-energy","title":"地热能开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/geothermal-energy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tidal-biomass-frontiers","title":"潮汐能与生物质能前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/tidal-biomass-frontiers"}]}]}